# Conformance probe pack for `stop <code>` in a sequential layout (spec 0.22):
# 24 bits of `ais6` whose text ends at the first `@` (code 0, also the
# padding). Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   24 bits       label  up to 3 characters, then `@`, then `@` padding
#   8 bits        y
format     conformance-long-stop-seq
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  24  chars:ais6  stop 0
field   probe.y      8   uint
